From efff412d6efcc17bc1b66d687814a7c84d464c67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:55:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: move the ENKA Balmumcu camera below the pressure centres
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The live camera sat in a narrow column beside the station card. It now
fills the content width under Basınç merkezleri, keeps the 90s refresh,
and waits until it scrolls into view.
---
